ponent has shown weakness by checking the flop. Checking allows me to see the river cheaply, control the pot size, and potentially win at showdown if my opponent also checks river. Betting risks building a pot with a very weak hand, and I'm already winning the match overall, so there's no need to force action in a marginal spot.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
